      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"ToolCallingChatOptions.Builder.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingChatOptions.Builder</code></a> initialized with the values of\nthis <a href=\"ToolCallingChatOptions.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.model.tool\"><code>ToolCallingChatOptions</code></a>.\n\nNarrows the return type of <a href=\"../../chat/prompt/ChatOptions.html#mutate()\"><code>ChatOptions.mutate()</code></a> so generic tool calling\ncode can chain methods without casting.",
